### Manual API requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client).
### Paste an access token from Keycloak into @token (see README for how to get one).

@host = http://localhost:5225
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health check (no token needed)
GET {{host}}/health

### List phone numbers visible to the current user
GET {{host}}/api/phones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a personal phone number
POST {{host}}/api/phones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ján Novák",
  "number": "+421 900 123 456",
  "visibility": "Personal"
}

### Add a shared phone number
POST {{host}}/api/phones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Recepcia",
  "number": "+421 2 1234 5678",
  "visibility": "Shared"
}

### Invalid request - should return 400 with validation errors
POST {{host}}/api/phones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "number": "abc"
}
